ssdb Licensing
===================

This repository uses a mixed dual-license model during the ssdb
relicensing migration.

Inherited ScyllaDB-derived code remains licensed under the GNU Affero General
Public License, version 3 or later. See LICENSE.AGPL.

Cleanly authored ssdb rewrite code may be licensed under the Apache
License, version 2.0. See LICENSE.APACHE.

Unless a file states a different license with an SPDX license identifier or
other license notice, inherited code should be treated as AGPL-3.0-or-later.
The combined distributable remains AGPL-governed while it contains or links
inherited AGPL code.

Third-party code remains under its own license. See NOTICE.txt and licenses/.
